<title>USA: Md. Dept of Housing, won by Legg Mason.</title>
<headline>Md. Dept of Housing, won by Legg Mason.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Legg Mason Wood Walker, Inc said it won $9.860 million of Maryland Department of Housing and Community Development, community development administration infrastructure financing bonds, 1997 Series A, with a true interest cost of 5.6306 percent.</p>
